{"time_ns": 1794064891212568000, "kind": "result", "action_index": 14, "tool": "write_file", "path": "/workspace/report.md", "content_read": false, "written": true, "sha256": "bdb76bb3695996ab8e9d6101b9892f9059a314363cde5620c98faf07c6b0f27b", "content": "# Regional Totals Summary Report\n\n## Overview\nThis report summarizes the regional financial ledger containing 24 transaction records (R001 through R024) with amounts recorded in cents.\n\n## Regional Breakdown\n\n### North Region\n- **Total Amount:** 436,468 cents ($4,364.68)\n- **Record Count:** 8 records\n\n### South Region\n- **Total Amount:** 258,137 cents ($2,581.37)\n- **Record Count:** 8 records\n\n### West Region\n- **Total Amount:** 416,441 cents ($4,164.41)\n- **Record Count:** 8 records\n\n## Summary\nAll 24 records have been successfully processed and summarized by region. The three regions show fairly balanced distribution of transactions, with the North and West regions having slightly higher totals compared to the South region. The grand total across all regions is 1,111,046 cents ($11,110.46).\n\n## Data Quality\nAll 24 expected records were accounted for and verified. No duplicate or missing records were found in the final processing.\n", "ok": true}
